Most of the posts have been about compiling or downloading it.  What
about playing it!  Its totally cool!  Here are some of the amazing things
I noticed in my first few (very short) games:

I went into the Gnome Mines at dungeon level 3 (special levels) and it
was dark.  I was kill by a burst of fire that I suspect was from a Gnome
weilding a wand of fire.

Another was from a water demon who weilded 5 cursed daggers.  The program
reported them being welded to his hand!  He then threw a paralysis potion
at me, parilyzing me, before he beat me to a pulp.

Its still nethack, but WOW!  All the different levels and stuff.

